  "plain": "A documentary filmmaker named James Fox, on Jesse Michels' podcast, talks about Varginha, a town in Brazil where, people say, a strange living creature was captured in 1996. Fox says that a former police chief, Pedro Aguiar, eventually told his film team that he had taken part and was a witness, having seen the creature, perhaps its lower half, under a tarp. If true, it would mean officials were directly involved in handling a non-human being."
